                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The First\nApprentice",
                                  "Rivet's first\napprentice made a\nbracket backward.\nShe kept it on the",
                                  "bench and asked\nthe apprentice to\ndesign a check\nthat would catch",
                                  "the next one. The\napprentice now\nruns inspections.\nThe backward",
                                  "bracket still\nholds the\ninstruction cards\nupright."
                                ],
